(7754819, 1282815, 75618, '<td valign="top">Love the cellphone? foreground bokeh and the warm lights contrasted with the cool tones in the water. Thanks for transporting me here to watch this performance! 9</td>', 'Love the cellphone? foreground bokeh and the warm lights contrasted with the cool tones in the water. Thanks for transporting me here to watch this performance! 9', '2023-07-24 18:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
