(7754830, 1282782, 177030, '<td valign="top">A studio setup to simulate panning. Not sure how you blurred the bottom, hoping that it is legal with standard editing. My biggest nitpick is the tires that appear to be flat with the editing technique.  An 8 from me.  A tanguera entry?  If it is, then the editing is definitely legal.</td>', 'A studio setup to simulate panning. Not sure how you blurred the bottom, hoping that it is legal with standard editing. My biggest nitpick is the tires that appear to be flat with the editing technique.  An 8 from me.  A tanguera entry?  If it is, then the editing is definitely legal.', '2023-07-24 19:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7754832, 1282743, 177030, '<td valign="top">A fitting title and well found image.  I think this will be somewhere in the top 5.</td>', 'A fitting title and well found image.  I think this will be somewhere in the top 5.', '2023-07-24 19:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7754834, 1282856, 177030, '<td valign="top">This has to be a markwiley drone image.  If my guess is wrong, then that is a compliment. Top 5.</td>', 'This has to be a markwiley drone image.  If my guess is wrong, then that is a compliment. Top 5.', '2023-07-24 19:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7754835, 1282857, 177030, '<td valign="top">A nice take on the theme. If you could have managed a sunset instead of the white sky, that would have made this image for me with the complimenting orange and black colors.</td>', 'A nice take on the theme. If you could have managed a sunset instead of the white sky, that would have made this image for me with the complimenting orange and black colors.', '2023-07-24 19:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
