(7754838, 1282719, 177030, '<td valign="top">Interesting image and take on the theme.  The bright sky on the right competes for my attention.  Wish there were more trees there to tone it down.</td>', 'Interesting image and take on the theme.  The bright sky on the right competes for my attention.  Wish there were more trees there to tone it down.', '2023-07-24 19:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
