(7755253, 1282855, 50864, '<td valign="top">This is pretty interesting with the truck and car in the car mirror and the car reflected in the truck. Nice catch and nicely processed to give a pleasing compositions and lots of interesting shapes. Even some drips on the truck for those of us that love drips. Topped off with a fabulous title.<br/> <br/>Team Spleen would like to give you our highest award, The Queen Spleen.<br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1282683" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50864/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1282683.jpg" xalt="'' . substr(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50864/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1282683.jpg'', strrpos(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50864/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1282683.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a></td>', 'This is pretty interesting with the truck and car in the car mirror and the car reflected in the truck. Nice catch and nicely processed to give a pleasing compositions and lots of interesting shapes. Even some drips on the truck for those of us that love drips. Topped off with a fabulous title. Team Spleen would like to give you our highest award, The Queen Spleen.', '2023-07-30 21:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755254, 1282585, 50864, '<td valign="top">So many pleasing little pictures in this one. Love the ripples through the bike and rider. The repeating vertical line with the crossing diagonals are oddly satisfying.<br/> <br/>Team Spleen has asked me to give you our highest award, the Spleen Queen.<br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1282683" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50864/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1282683.jpg" xalt="'' . substr(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50864/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1282683.jpg'', strrpos(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50864/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1282683.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a></td>', 'So many pleasing little pictures in this one. Love the ripples through the bike and rider. The repeating vertical line with the crossing diagonals are oddly satisfying. Team Spleen has asked me to give you our highest award, the Spleen Queen.', '2023-07-30 21:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755255, 1282587, 50864, '<td valign="top">The earth torn up and flying everywhere. Smoke obscures. An allegory for our time?<br/> <br/>Team Spleen would be honored by your presence in the Queen''s Court.<br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1156027" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50641/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1156027.jpg" xalt="'' . substr(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50641/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1156027.jpg'', strrpos(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50641/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1156027.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a></td>', 'The earth torn up and flying everywhere. Smoke obscures. An allegory for our time? Team Spleen would be honored by your presence in the Queen''s Court.', '2023-07-30 21:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755259, 1282604, 50864, '<td valign="top">The diagonal wires, the  criss cross wires and large smooth arches all make an exciting composition nestled in the deep tones of the left upper corner and contrasting bright light of the right lower corner. And then there are interesting shadows and shapes..and people. So nice.<br/> <br/>Team Spleen would be honored by your presence in the Queen''s Court<br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1156027" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50641/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1156027.jpg" xalt="'' . substr(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50641/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1156027.jpg'', strrpos(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50641/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1156027.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2023-07-31 00:07:55.</i></td>', 'The diagonal wires, the  criss cross wires and large smooth arches all make an exciting composition nestled in the deep tones of the left upper corner and contrasting bright light of the right lower corner. And then there are interesting shadows and shapes..and people. So nice. Team Spleen would be honored by your presence in the Queen''s Court', '2023-07-30 23:15:12.000000', '2023-07-31 01:07:55.000000', 1),
