(7755274, 1282831, 114285, '<td valign="top">Seriously Don 100%, absolutely fantastic photo!<br/> <br/>I wouldve been so proud to have shot something like this, perfect, in every way. And I loved the fragments of earth the tyres brought forth, perfectly composed image and wonderful edit, if indeed you did edit it, doesnt look like much was done. I cannot understand why this did not score over eight. Would love to know how many takes it took to achieve this.<br/> <br/>Many congratulations on your personal best. <br/> <br/>Adding as a favourite.</td>', 'Seriously Don 100%, absolutely fantastic photo! I wouldve been so proud to have shot something like this, perfect, in every way. And I loved the fragments of earth the tyres brought forth, perfectly composed image and wonderful edit, if indeed you did edit it, doesnt look like much was done. I cannot understand why this did not score over eight. Would love to know how many takes it took to achieve this. Many congratulations on your personal best.  Adding as a favourite.', '2023-07-31 01:14:49.000000', NULL, 0),
